===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|fa-cls|افغانستان|tr=Afğānistān}}, from {{m|fa-cls|افغان||the [[Afghan]], the [[Afghans]]|tr=Afğân}} + {{m|fa-cls|ـستان||[[-istan]]: [[land]] of|tr=-estân}}, equivalent to {{af|en|Afghan|-i-|-stan}}.

